[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656861142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3656861142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3656861142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Z90XW","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-15T17:43:12Z","updated_at":"2025-12-15T17:43:12Z","body":"I haven't looked deeper into it, but it occurred to me that it'd be extra nice if there was a way to add \"Recognize as TextFile\"/\"Recognize as Binary File\" buttons to the error/warning window, which would just append it to the relevant setting without the user needing to go into their editor settings.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3656861142/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3868531315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3868531315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3868531315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mlRpz","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T23:10:28Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T23:10:28Z","body":"At least a button to open the relevant settings page would be useful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3868531315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3873314217","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3873314217","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3873314217,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7m3hWp","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T18:39:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T18:39:21Z","body":"It looks to me like the `EditorNode::show_warning()` method this message wraps an `AcceptDialog`, but the method doesn't provide a way to add extra buttons.\r\n\r\nBased on this, I'm thinking it might be best to:\r\n- Use this PR for now, just giving the user instructions on where to go to add extensions to the editor.\r\n- Work on another PR that adds the ability to specify additional button actions to `EditorNode::show_warning()`.\r\n- Once that's accepted (or perhaps as a part of it), add buttons to this warning message that open the settings or add the specified extension to the settings.\r\n\r\nEven if the button-adding PRs take longer to get approved and/or merged, the simpler message-only PR can still help to some extent.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3873314217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3873396134","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3873396134",