Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T05:01:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T05:01:16Z","body":"> Or you can just add a new AcceptDialog and use it instead of `show_warning()`.\r\n\r\nGood point, I can certainly look into adding an AcceptDialog to FileSystemDock which includes a button to open the settings and/or add the file extension.\r\n\r\nThe more generalized solution of allowing custom actions to be passed to `show_warning()` might prove useful for other spots in the editor as well, but I could see implementing that creeping up the scope a fair bit. So maybe it'd be best to investigate later on down the road.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3875353415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3892720242","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3892720242","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3892720242,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oBjJy","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-12T18:38:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-12T18:38:04Z","body":"This PR now uses its own AcceptDialog which includes a button to open the section of the Editor Settings where the file extensions can be configured:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46994536-4eba-4e05-99d6-f537ffeb3db1\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3892720242/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3900376504","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3900376504","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3900376504,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oewW4","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-14T01:18:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-14T01:18:44Z","body":"Thanks for the suggestion and approval! While implementing the suggestion, I discovered that apparently the FileSystem settings are considered part of the advanced settings, so they don't show up if the user doesn't have advanced settings toggled on when they click the \"Show Editor Settings\" button. I'm going to make it so that it enables advanced settings before navigating to the page, and then squash everything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3900376504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3904894082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114045#issuecomment-3904894082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114045","id":3904894082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ov_SC","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","